+    // Stage 2 (verdict 6.1): the armed card keeps a persistent topaz ring so the
+    // human can always see which advisor is loaded into the verdict. Stronger
+    // than the compare focus ring and the hover lift, listed after both so armed
+    // wins (mockup-mdm-states .ms.armed .check.lead).
+    &.armed,
+    &.armed.focus,
+    &.actionable.armed:hover {
